{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40710","headline":"寄南岳僧 · 李洞","name":"寄南岳僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新秋日後晒书天，白日当松影却圆。\n五字句求方寸佛，一条街擘两行蝉。\n不曾着事於机内，长合教山在眼前。\n花落俦公房外石，调猿弄虎叹无缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}